WEBVTT

00:03:29.204 --> 00:03:30.496
It was no big deal.

00:03:30.538 --> 00:03:34.329
The thing I love about the purple flag
is how efficient it is.

00:03:34.371 --> 00:03:37.579
TB: Flagging the bias didn't prevent us
from getting the work done.

00:03:37.579 --> 00:03:39.871
In fact, it helps us
work together more honestly.

00:03:39.913 --> 00:03:42.538
KS: It's even harder
when I don't know what I did wrong.

00:03:42.579 --> 00:03:44.329
Once, I asked someone out to lunch.

00:03:44.371 --> 00:03:45.746
Out came the purple flag.

00:03:45.788 --> 00:03:48.454
I had no idea why,

00:03:48.454 --> 00:03:51.038
so I was relieved to know
what to say next.

00:03:51.079 --> 00:03:53.496
"Thank you for pointing it out,
but I don't get it.

00:03:53.496 --> 00:03:55.079
Could we talk after the meeting?"

00:03:55.121 --> 00:03:58.954
Afterwards, the person reminded me
that they were fasting for Ramadan.

00:03:58.996 --> 00:04:00.954
It instantly made sense to me,